<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13002" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκωλ-ύω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ύσω [ῡ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hinder</i> or <i>prevent from</i> a thing, or its
			use, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ τῆς ὁδοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					3.3.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ec.</u>
					2.10
				</span></i>
			: c. inf., <i>prevent from</i> doing, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				1411
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				150c
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τοῦ ποιεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Hier.</u>
					8.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. μὴ ἐλθεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>An.</u>
					6.4.24
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc. only,
				<i>keep off, hinder,</i> Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.66
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> abs.,
				<i>stop the way,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.72
			</span></i>: impers., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν ἀποκωλύει</span>
			<i>there is</i> nothing <i>to prevent</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				372e
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>shut up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέκνα εἰς οἶκον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>1 Ki.</u>
					6.10
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
